        "title": "卷: measure compatible referents",
        "blocks": [
          {
            "text": "卷 pronounced juàn counts bound volumes or examination papers. It differs from juǎn meaning roll up.",
            "examples": [
              {
                "text": "这套书有三卷。",
                "pinyin": "zhè tào shū yǒu sān juàn 。",
                "meaning": "This set of books has three volumes.",
                "audio": "d45bd73b95b70c03c88dcadbdd820821716723ea1128f5335b77bea77ab5ec29"
              },
              {
                "text": "请看第一卷。",
                "pinyin": "qǐng kàn dì yī juàn 。",
                "meaning": "Please look at volume one.",
                "audio": "6fc8e0030ce0b3cb3ed88f47ca3157785aae242a45bcc04b3322c47f2cac9943"
              }
